   sometimes before CLI Pulse has run — so they cannot go through L10n, and they follow
   the system language rather than the in-app language switcher.
   Keys are the English literals in the intent source; `${provider}` stands for the
   `\(\.$provider)` interpolation in GetProviderQuotaIntent.parameterSummary. */

